= Bronisław Ziemięcki

Ziemięcki represents the Piłsudczyk current while favoring conditional parliamentary cooperation.

- @conditional_toleration
- @municipal_socialism
- @root: Return to main

@conditional_toleration
title: Conditional Toleration
subtitle: When PPS supports a minority cabinet of Śliwiński or Piłsudski from outside, by an agreement: dissent falls in Centrum (−10) and Lewica (−8). The kind of support does not change.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'ziemiecki', 'conditional_toleration').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_conditional_toleration_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'ziemiecki', 'conditional_toleration');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@municipal_socialism
title: Municipal Socialism
subtitle: 1 resource; in the large cities the base reach of PPS grows (+8) and PPS gains among workers, intelligentsia and petty bourgeoisie. No town hall or city budget.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'ziemiecki', 'municipal_socialism').available !}
